=== 127.0.0.1-0.json
ok    schema           the record holds to releve-record/2
ok    record-hash      the record's canonical bytes hash to the hash it is delivered with
ok    prev-link        the record follows from the one before it
ok    inclusion-path   the path leads from the record's hash to the root
ok    root             the root is the root of the record's own cycle
ok    published        the root and its token stand in the published list, and the list runs unbroken
ok    tsa-token        the time-stamp token covers the root, under the authority's signature
ok    beacon-round     the round is of drand quicknet, and its randomness is the hash of its signature
ok    beacon-signature the round is signed by the League of Entropy's quicknet key
ok    order            the order is the one the round gives, the pages read follow it, the first pick heads them, and the page is among the picks
ok    committed        the candidates were committed to, and the commitment dated by the authority
ok    before-beacon    the candidates were dated before the round, and the round is the first one after: the round chose, not the Bureau
verified: every check holds
exit 0
